---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import InstantSnapshot from '../components/InstantSnapshot.astro';
import HomeIcon from '../components/HomeIcon.astro';
import '../assets/_homepage-interactions.scss';

const pageTitle = 'Digitful - Real Growth Systems';
const pageDescription =
  'Digitful helps businesses make marketing work as one connected system, from message and reach to action and follow-up.';
const pageCanonical = 'https://digitful.ca/';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} canonicalUrl={pageCanonical}>
  <main class="home-page">
    <section class="home-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="home-hero__grid">
          <div class="home-hero__copy">
            <span class="eyebrow">Growth systems</span>
            <h1>Marketing works better when the parts talk to each other.</h1>
            <p class="lead">
              Marketing works better when the whole journey works together.
            </p>
            <div class="home-hero__actions">
              <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4">Tell us what’s stuck</a>
              <a href="/what-we-build/" class="btn btn-link-quiet btn-lg">See what we build</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="home-hero__visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="home-hero__orb"></span>
            <span class="home-hero__scribble home-hero__scribble--top">less manual work<br />more progress</span>

            <div class="home-system-map">
              <div class="home-system-map__meta">
                <span>Growth system / signal map</span>
                <span>01—04</span>
              </div>
              <div class="home-system-map__flow">
                <div class="home-system-map__node">
                  <span class="home-system-map__number">01</span>
                  <strong>Say the right thing</strong>
                  <small>Message + priorities</small>
                </div>
                <div class="home-system-map__node">
                  <span class="home-system-map__number">02</span>
                  <strong>Reach the right people</strong>
                  <small>Search + social + paid</small>
                </div>
                <div class="home-system-map__node">
                  <span class="home-system-map__number">03</span>
                  <strong>Make the next step clear</strong>
                  <small>Easy to act on</small>
                </div>
                <div class="home-system-map__node home-system-map__node--accent">
                  <span class="home-system-map__number">04</span>
                  <strong>Follow through</strong>
                  <small>Fewer manual gaps</small>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <span class="home-hero__sticker">fix → improve → grow</span>
            <span class="home-hero__note">less friction between the parts</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section home-section--issues" aria-labelledby="home-fix-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="home-editorial-row home-editorial-row--issues">
          <header class="home-section__head home-section__head--compact">
            <span class="eyebrow">Where things usually go wrong</span>
            <h2 id="home-fix-heading">More traffic won’t fix a messy system.</h2>
          </header>

          <div class="home-issue-grid" role="list">
            <article class="home-issue" role="listitem">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--coral"><HomeIcon name="message" /></span>
              <h3>
                <button type="button" class="home-issue__trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="home-issue-unclear-reveal" data-issue-trigger="unclear">
                  <span>Unclear message</span><span class="home-issue__cue" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div id="home-issue-unclear-reveal" class="home-issue__reveal" hidden>
                <p class="home-issue__punchline">Exactly. Just like this one.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="home-issue" role="listitem">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--mustard"><HomeIcon name="funnel" /></span>
              <h3>
                <button type="button" class="home-issue__trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="home-issue-next-step-reveal" data-issue-trigger="next-step">
                  <span>No clear next step</span><span class="home-issue__cue" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div id="home-issue-next-step-reveal" class="home-issue__reveal home-issue__reveal--next-step" hidden>
                <div class="home-issue__path-demo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="home-issue__path-line"></span><span class="home-issue__path-dot"></span><span class="home-issue__path-target"></span></div>
                <p class="home-issue__punchline">And… now what?</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="home-issue" role="listitem">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--teal"><HomeIcon name="clock" /></span>
              <h3>
                <button type="button" class="home-issue__trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="home-issue-slow-reveal" data-issue-trigger="slow">
                  <span>Slow follow-up</span><span class="home-issue__cue" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div id="home-issue-slow-reveal" class="home-issue__reveal home-issue__reveal--slow" hidden>
                <span class="home-issue__timer" data-followup-timer aria-hidden="true">0.000s</span>
                <p class="home-issue__punchline" data-followup-message hidden>That was only a second. Some leads wait days.</p>
                <span class="home-issue__sr-status" data-followup-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section home-services" aria-labelledby="home-services-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="home-editorial-row home-editorial-row--services">
          <header class="home-section__head home-section__head--compact">
            <span class="eyebrow">What we actually do</span>
            <h2 id="home-services-heading">This is where we usually get involved.</h2>
          </header>

          <div class="home-services-grid">
            <a href="/social-media/" class="home-service">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--teal"><HomeIcon name="megaphone" /></span>
              <div>
                <h3>Social Media</h3>
                <p>Make the brand clearer, more useful, and easier to remember.</p>
              </div>
              <span class="home-service__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/seo/" class="home-service">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--mustard"><HomeIcon name="search" /></span>
              <div>
                <h3>SEO</h3>
                <p>Show up for the searches that can actually turn into business.</p>
              </div>
              <span class="home-service__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/paid-ads/" class="home-service">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--coral"><HomeIcon name="cursor" /></span>
              <div>
                <h3>Paid Ads</h3>
                <p>Put budget behind the right message, audience, and next step.</p>
              </div>
              <span class="home-service__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/automation/" class="home-service">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--teal"><HomeIcon name="gear" /></span>
              <div>
                <h3>Process Automation</h3>
                <p>Remove the repetitive handoffs that slow people down and lose leads.</p>
              </div>
              <span class="home-service__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-fit" aria-labelledby="home-fit-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="home-fit__grid">
          <header class="home-fit__intro">
            <span class="eyebrow">Probably a good fit if...</span>
            <h2 id="home-fit-heading">The business is moving. The system is lagging behind.</h2>
            <span class="home-fit__scribble" aria-hidden="true">signal first.<br />friction second.</span>
          </header>

          <div class="home-fit__list" role="list">
            <article class="home-fit__item" role="listitem">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--mustard"><HomeIcon name="chart" /></span>
              <div>
                <h3>You already have demand</h3>
                <p>The problem is not whether people care. It is what happens next.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="home-fit__item" role="listitem">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--coral"><HomeIcon name="nodes" /></span>
              <div>
                <h3>Priorities keep competing</h3>
                <p>Too many channels, tools, and “urgent” ideas. Not enough signal.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="home-fit__item" role="listitem">
              <span class="home-icon-disc home-icon-disc--teal"><HomeIcon name="clipboard" /></span>
              <div>
                <h3>Manual work keeps multiplying</h3>
                <p>If the same task happens every week, someone should ask why.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <InstantSnapshot />

    <section class="home-cta" aria-labelledby="home-cta-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="home-cta__grid">
          <header>
            <span class="eyebrow">Next move</span>
            <h2 id="home-cta-heading">Bring the messy version.</h2>
          </header>
          <div>
            <p>
              The funnel, the tools, the bottlenecks, the things nobody has had time to fix. We’ll help you work out what matters first.
            </p>
            <div class="home-cta__actions">
              <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4">Talk to Digitful</a>
              <a
                href="https://chatgpt.com/g/g-DmZRaiTLa-digitful-marketing-analyst"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg px-4"
              >
                Try the Digitful GPT
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script is:inline src="/scripts/home-issue-interactions.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
